# JavaScript on GitHub

Write JavaScript, JavaScript or JavaScript; push to GitHub.

Emphasis: *JavaScript*, __GitHub__ and _JavaScript_.

A [GitHub link](https://example.com) and an ![image of JavaScript](logo.png).

Code: `JavaScript` in a span.

```javascript
const GitHub = "GitHub";
```

